{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02500","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 岑文本","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲第多清赏，芳辰命羽巵。\n书帷通竹径，琴台枕槿篱。\n池疑夜壑徙，山似郁洲移。\n雕楹网萝薜，激濑合埙篪。\n鸟戏翻新叶，鱼跃动清漪。\n自得淹留趣，宁劳攀桂枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑文本","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}